---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const CALENDLY_URL = "https://calendly.com/migueldiaseu/30min";
---

<Layout title="VSM & Flow Engineering Facilitation Training - Miguel Dias">
  <main class="pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
      <a href="/" class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:underline font-medium mb-8 inline-block">← Home</a>

      <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] font-medium mb-2">5 sessions × 1h30</p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">VSM & Flow Engineering Facilitation Training</h1>
        <img src="/images/workshops/image2.jpg" alt="VSM facilitation workshop" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-lg object-cover aspect-[16/9] mt-6" />
      </header>

      <!-- What You'll Learn (verbatim from PDF) -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">What You'll Learn</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">In this practical training, you will learn how to prepare and facilitate a full VSM workshop using Flow Engineering and working with your own team's real challenges.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">The goal is for you to get as much practical experience with VSM as possible. You'll walk away with the technical know-how, templates and confidence to keep facilitating these sessions in your organization.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We'll work together on the challenges in your actual value stream, whether that's Feature Idea to Production, Code Commit to Deployment, Incident Resolution, or Customer Onboarding. You'll map it, measure it, and design improvements during the workshop.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">I'll point you to the mistakes I made when facilitating these workshops, so you can avoid them.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Workshop Agenda -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Workshop Agenda</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">Each session starts at 2pm London time and lasts for 1h30.</p>

        <!-- Vertical timeline -->
        <div class="relative space-y-0">
          <!-- Timeline line -->
          <div class="absolute left-5 top-6 bottom-6 w-0.5 bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/20"></div>

          <!-- Day 1 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-5 pb-8">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm z-10">1</div>
            <div class="pt-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-1">Monday</p>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-2">Introduction to VSM + Outcome Mapping</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>Result:</strong> Define improvement needs, goals, benefits, and next steps</p>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-500 italic">Risk mitigated: Investing in irrelevant improvements</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 2 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-5 pb-8">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm z-10">2</div>
            <div class="pt-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-1">Tuesday</p>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-2">Current State Value Stream Mapping</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>Result:</strong> Visualize delivery, find and measure key constraints</p>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-500 italic">Risk mitigated: Optimizing a process with no impact on your Outcome</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 3 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-5 pb-8">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm z-10">3</div>
            <div class="pt-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-1">Wednesday</p>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-2">Dependency Mapping</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>Result:</strong> Connect bottlenecks to dependencies</p>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-500 italic">Risk mitigated: Insufficient understanding of the main constraints</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 4 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-5 pb-8">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm z-10">4</div>
            <div class="pt-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-1">Thursday</p>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-2">Future State Value Stream Mapping</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>Result:</strong> Team re-designs delivery for fast flow and high quality</p>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-500 italic">Risk mitigated: Failing to create a visible target for change</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Day 5 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-5">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm z-10">5</div>
            <div class="pt-1.5">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[rgb(67,97,238)] mb-1">Friday</p>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-2">Improvement Roadmap + Follow-up</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-700 mb-1"><strong>Result:</strong> 3 month Roadmap to achieve the Outcome: owners and progress metrics</p>
              <p class="text-base text-gray-500 italic">Risk mitigated: Failing to integrate improvements into each team's work</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-8">I won't leave you hanging after the workshop: includes 1h VSM coaching and templates to support you in running your own workshop in your organization.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Who Should Attend -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Who Should Attend</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">This workshop is for leaders and practitioners who need to improve cross-team delivery:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Product/Engineering Leaders</strong> dealing with slow feature delivery, misaligned teams, or unclear bottlenecks</li>
          <li><strong>DevOps/Platform Engineers</strong> trying to reduce deployment pain and improve flow across multiple teams</li>
          <li><strong>Agile Coaches/Scrum Masters</strong> who need concrete tools to facilitate system-level improvements (not just team-level)</li>
          <li><strong>Delivery/Service Managers</strong> struggling with incidents, delays, or cross-team coordination</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">No VSM experience required. I'll share lessons from 5 cross-team VSM initiatives, helping you avoid common pitfalls and facilitate your own sessions successfully.</p>
        <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[rgb(67,97,238)] pl-4 py-2 my-6 text-gray-700 italic">"Miguel organized everything for us, we just had to join the workshops and get immediate value from them. We invested a bit, but the outcome is huge. Even if no further actions are taken, simply doing the workshops shows you what the bottlenecks are, what's slowing you down, and what is hurting the processes."<br /><span class="text-sm not-italic text-gray-500">— Jukka Palosaari, Director of Engineering, Relex Solutions</span></blockquote>
      </section>

      <!-- Typical Motivations for VSM -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Typical Motivations for VSM</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Value Stream Mapping and Flow Engineering help with the thorniest problems. This is for you if you're experiencing some of these:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Releases cause expensive disruptions, losing customers</li>
          <li>25-50% of time spent fixing customer problems</li>
          <li>Too much work and too little capacity</li>
          <li>Slow customer onboarding loses deals</li>
          <li>Can't deliver features fast enough to stay competitive, close deals</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Typical Results from VSM -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Typical Results from VSM</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>+60% faster delivery (prev. clients)</li>
          <li>−20% production defects</li>
          <li>Release on demand (ex: weekly)</li>
          <li>−20% time in manual work (do more with the same people)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">The results you get depend on your context: the bigger the existing delays, quality problems and political will for improvement, the bigger opportunities you may find.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">Because Software delivery is more about people than software, you can get immediate improvements in these sessions, where the people with the power to change and the people with the know-how about the change are present, and they are anchored on the same target outcome and looking at the same value stream data: change happens in hours, not weeks.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Logistics -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Logistics</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">There are no pre-requisites, you'll learn everything you need during the workshop session.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">You're encouraged to bring along as many of your team members as possible, so you can learn together, use your own context as much as possible and even find some quick wins.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- About Flowtopia -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">About our hosts, Flowtopia</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Flowtopia is the community for flow and value stream professionals and practitioners to connect, learn, grow and flow.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Pricing -->
      <section class="mb-12" data-pricing="facilitation">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Pricing</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-3">Public (Open seats)</h3>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-1">&euro;500 per person</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">5 sessions + 1h coaching</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Only 10 spots available</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-3">Private (Team cohort)</h3>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-1">&euro;1,500 per person</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Team cohort</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a
          href={CALENDLY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-private-training-cta="facilitation"
          data-track-book-call="workshops-facilitation-private"
          class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-[rgb(240,242,245)] p-6 transition-all hover:border-[rgb(67,97,238)]/40 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)]">Want this for your team?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Private cohorts are tailored to your value stream.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90">
            Book a Call →
          </span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <!-- Schedule -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Schedule</h2>
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Public Training:</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">2:00 p.m. London time</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Coming soon.</p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Private Training:</p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Your choice of date and time.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <a
          href={CALENDLY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-workshop-register="facilitation"
          data-track-book-call="workshops-facilitation"
          class="inline-block bg-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:bg-[rgb(67,97,238)]/90 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          Book a Call for Private Training
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Learn More -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Learn More</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">Have any questions or suggestions? Ping me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/migueldiaseu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[rgb(67,97,238)] hover:underline">LinkedIn</a> or miguel@migueldias.eu</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Photos from Previous Workshops -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[rgb(33,48,118)] mb-4">Photos from Previous Workshops</h2>
        <a href="/blog/2025-02-17-mika-schafroth-testimonial" data-testimonial="mika-schafroth" class="block hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[rgb(67,97,238)] pl-4 py-2 my-4 text-gray-700 italic">"The value stream mapping Miguel organized for our Identity Service team had several impacts. On one side, a tremendous potential was unveiled how the process of deploying changes can be improved. On the other, it was a great team building exercise."</blockquote>
          <p class="text-gray-600">— Mika Schafroth, Director of Engineering, Relex Solutions</p>
        </a>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3" aria-label="Workshop photos">
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image1.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image2.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image3.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image4.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image5.jpg" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
          <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow-md"><img src="/images/workshops/image6.png" alt="VSM workshop" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
